author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Row-collection discovery reaches nested collections, so a command whose payload sits below the top level is reducible by the same ladder as one whose payload sits at it; The whole-result omission rung is reachable only after every earlier rung has been applied and has failed to fit, proven by a case whose bulk is nested; The omission receipt reports the estimated size of the result that was omitted, not the size of the envelope that reports the omission; The AGENTS.md-prescribed diagnostic invocation returns a machine-readable verdict at the default budget, or the recommendation names the budget it needs; A regression test drives a real nested-payload governance read past its ceiling and asserts the rung that fired"
parent: pm-33cw
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: "Extended the universal budget ladder with recursive nested collection discovery while preserving declared pagination row semantics, added truthful pre-omission size and compaction-path receipts, and made truncation recovery universal."
expected_result: "Nested governance payloads degrade through strings and nested row collections before whole-result omission, and the default validate diagnostic returns a usable machine verdict."
actual_result: "The 2,477-item validate diagnostic fits at the 9,000-token default after two nested arrays compact, reports both paths and a working unbounded recovery; focused tests pass."
